<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 29.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 29.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 29	May 28   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  272.920     272.220     247.020   10.48 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  312.000     311.950     306.830    1.68 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  160.200     160.135     158.970    0.77 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.412	47.426	47.182    0.49 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  447.000     445.980     419.180    6.64 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.415     142.385     141.685    0.52 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.181	16.234	16.185   -0.02 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  234.540     235.290     212.430   10.41 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.893	 1.896	 1.888    0.26 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.582	 1.589	 1.581    0.06 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  192.570     191.930     183.135    5.15 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
